               ],
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "On this sacred mountain, there is a staircase on its frontal face leading to a pyramidal structure. At the top of this structure, there is a room with windows. Finally, at the highest point, there is an open area for celebrations.",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p>Mesoamerican pyramidal structures, rich in detail, were often used as ceremonial centers and were known to the inhabitants as \"sacred mountains\" (<i>Witz</i>) (<htcite0>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
